{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":41001957,"chapterID":40000012,"chapterNumber":"7","codePrefix":"BC","codeVersion":"CodeContent/authored/new-york-city/2014-construction-codes/bundle.json#1","sectionNumber":"721.2.2.3","title":"Multicourse roofs.","officialText":"The fire-resistance ratings of roofs which consist of a base slab of concrete with a topping (overlay) of an insulating concrete or with an insulating board and built-up roofing shall comply with Figures 721.2.2.3(1) and 721.2.2.3(2).\nFor SI: 1 inch = 25.4 mm.\nFor SI: 1 inch = 25.4 mm.","previewText":"The fire-resistance ratings of roofs which consist of a base slab of concrete with a topping (overlay) of an insulating concrete or with an insulating board and built-up roofing shall comply with Figures 721.2.2.3(1) and 721.2.2.3(2).\nFor SI: 1 inch = 25.4 mm.\nFor SI: 1 inch = 25.4 mm.","blocks":[{"id":"nyc-2014-41001957-text","kind":"html","html":"<p>The fire-resistance ratings of roofs which consist of a base slab of concrete with a topping (overlay) of an insulating concrete or with an insulating board and built-up roofing shall comply with Figures 721.2.2.3(1) and 721.2.2.3(2).<br>For SI: 1 inch = 25.4 mm.<br>For SI: 1 inch = 25.4 mm.</p>","plainText":"The fire-resistance ratings of roofs which consist of a base slab of concrete with a topping (overlay) of an insulating concrete or with an insulating board and built-up roofing shall comply with Figures 721.2.2.3(1) and 721.2.2.3(2).\nFor SI: 1 inch = 25.4 mm.\nFor SI: 1 inch = 25.4 mm."},{"id":"2014-bc-7-p0072-figure-01.png-block","kind":"image","imageID":"2014-bc-7-p0072-figure-01.png","caption":"FIGURE 721.2.2.3(1)","plainText":"","reviewRequired":true,"researchClaimEligible":false,"officialPDFProvenance":{"sourceURL":"https://www.nyc.gov/assets/buildings/codes-pdf/cons_codes_2014/2014CC_BC_Chapter_7_Fire-Resistance-Rated_Construction.pdf","sourceSHA256":"f943f5ff2ed95d15528e81e030066857b49c09f76bcac1718f81e616a3fcfd62","pdfPage":72,"bbox":[36.0,54.0,57